## Design Flow

The design was implemented using the complete LibreLane ASIC flow.

```
Verilog RTL
      │
      ▼
Linting
      │
      ▼
Logic Synthesis (Yosys)
      │
      ▼
Floorplanning
      │
      ▼
Power Distribution Network (PDN)
      │
      ▼
Placement
      │
      ▼
Clock Tree Synthesis (Skipped - Combinational Design)
      │
      ▼
Routing
      │
      ▼
Static Timing Analysis (STA)
      │
      ▼
Design Rule Check (DRC)
      │
      ▼
Layout vs Schematic (LVS)
      │
      ▼
GDSII Generation
```

